{"395370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Astrobase Command", "steam_appid": 395370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your species blew up its previous galaxy. For all the usual reasons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One wormhole later, a Cryoship filled with ten thousand of your civilization's &quot;best and brightest&quot; lands on the new homeworld. The terraforming begins, and an Astrobase is deployed to orbit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From behind your virtual desk, you build up the Astrobase, while sending out ships to explore the vast galactic expanse. Crew make their own decisions, and its up to you to manage their personalities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From killbots to brainworms, death comes in many forms. But the species must survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A notice drops in the inbox: the Mainframe is hungry for crystals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/395370/extras/32d58cfa54ed5c2f586ab121e0a5a59d.poster.avif?t=1780348536\" width=1152 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/395370/extras/32d58cfa54ed5c2f586ab121e0a5a59d.webm?t=1780348536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/395370/extras/32d58cfa54ed5c2f586ab121e0a5a59d.mp4?t=1780348536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every job is done by a person, and every person has a life</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/395370/extras/5c7ffae74f8ebb1c69ca69ee4c2b218b.poster.avif?t=1780348536\" width=1152 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/395370/extras/5c7ffae74f8ebb1c69ca69ee4c2b218b.webm?t=1780348536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/395370/extras/5c7ffae74f8ebb1c69ca69ee4c2b218b.mp4?t=1780348536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spacial-logical resource economy to manage and balance</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/395370/extras/e428db96aca4547a1928cd218976d1f8.poster.avif?t=1780348536\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/395370/extras/e428db96aca4547a1928cd218976d1f8.webm?t=1780348536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/395370/extras/e428db96aca4547a1928cd218976d1f8.mp4?t=1780348536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decisions have far-reaching consequences, and most problems are of your own design</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/395370/extras/043b2eb14ed582dd8319bab8186e3112.poster.avif?t=1780348536\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/395370/extras/043b2eb14ed582dd8319bab8186e3112.webm?t=1780348536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/395370/extras/043b2eb14ed582dd8319bab8186e3112.mp4?t=1780348536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters are connected through a web of relationships</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/395370/extras/3e425c7f4852ef1b6234319e4503f233.poster.avif?t=1780348536\" width=1152 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/395370/extras/3e425c7f4852ef1b6234319e4503f233.webm?t=1780348536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/395370/extras/3e425c7f4852ef1b6234319e4503f233.mp4?t=1780348536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rogue-like RPG text-adventures spun into overarching storylines</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/395370/extras/0174bd92f04dd2e48602ed597f146cba.poster.avif?t=1780348536\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/395370/extras/0174bd92f04dd2e48602ed597f146cba.webm?t=1780348536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/395370/extras/0174bd92f04dd2e48602ed597f146cba.mp4?t=1780348536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your species dies if the Mainframe loses power. That's what the manual says, anyway</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/395370/extras/d8cfe5bd50d04148fc39d7a31f65fb6b.poster.avif?t=1780348536\" width=1152 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/395370/extras/d8cfe5bd50d04148fc39d7a31f65fb6b.webm?t=1780348536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/395370/extras/d8cfe5bd50d04148fc39d7a31f65fb6b.mp4?t=1780348536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your species blew up its previous galaxy. For all the usual reasons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One wormhole later, a Cryoship filled with ten thousand of your civilization's &quot;best and brightest&quot; lands on the new homeworld. The terraforming begins, and an Astrobase is deployed to orbit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From behind your virtual desk, you build up the Astrobase, while sending out ships to explore the vast galactic expanse. Crew make their own decisions, and its up to you to manage their personalities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From killbots to brainworms, death comes in many forms. But the species must survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A notice drops in the inbox: the Mainframe is hungry for crystals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/395370/extras/32d58cfa54ed5c2f586ab121e0a5a59d.poster.avif?t=1780348536\" width=1152 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/395370/extras/32d58cfa54ed5c2f586ab121e0a5a59d.webm?t=1780348536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/395370/extras/32d58cfa54ed5c2f586ab121e0a5a59d.mp4?t=1780348536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every job is done by a person, and every person has a life</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/395370/extras/5c7ffae74f8ebb1c69ca69ee4c2b218b.poster.avif?t=1780348536\" width=1152 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/395370/extras/5c7ffae74f8ebb1c69ca69ee4c2b218b.webm?t=1780348536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic